{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>TVB宣布將開拓劇集新賽道，引入現時在內地極之流行的「豎屏短劇」模式，而打頭陣的頭炮作品，竟然是經典宮鬥神劇《金枝慾孽》的番外篇《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳》！消息一出即時震撼全城，官方更率先公開六大主角造型，勢必引爆全網追劇熱潮！ TV</p>\n<p>\nTVB宣布將開拓劇集新賽道，引入現時在內地極之流行的紅果平台「豎屏短劇」模式，而打頭陣的頭炮作品，竟然是2003年經典宮鬥神劇《金枝慾孽》的番外篇《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳》！消息一出即時震撼全城，官方更率先公開六大主角造型，勢必引爆全網追劇熱潮！\n</p>\n<h2>TVB開拓劇集新賽道 引入內地爆紅豎屏短劇</h2>\n<p>面對觀眾追劇習慣的改變，TVB在2027年將有新搞作，宣佈與內地大型短劇平台「紅果短劇」達成合作，正式開啟劇集新賽道，開拍節奏明快、適合手機觀看的豎屏短劇。這種劇集模式在內地已發展得相當成熟，深受年輕觀眾歡迎，TVB此舉被視為力求革新，緊貼市場潮流的重要一步。而選擇20023年以經典IP《金枝慾孽》打頭陣，足見對此新模式的重視。</p>\n<h2>「番外篇」6大主角曝光 龔嘉欣陳自瑤列陣</h2>\n<p>為隆重其事，TVB在巡禮預告片中，率先公開了番外篇《金枝慾孽之宮牆折柳》的六大主角陣容及造型。名單星光熠熠，包括視帝陳豪，夥拍龔嘉欣、陳自瑤、倪嘉雯、阮浩棕及陳楨怡，造型尚未曝光還有鄭子誠飾演的「皇帝」一角！</p>\n<h2>陳豪重演2003年侍衞孔武</h2>\n<p>陳豪飾演的孔武是宮中待衛，在第一集《金枝慾孽》第30集與爾淳成功逃離紫禁城，之後在續集《金枝慾孽貳》飾演「高老闆」高流斐，今之短劇版本他重拾23年前的角色，以黑衣神秘造型再度演出帶刀待衛。</p>\n<h2>陳自瑤倪嘉雯首次同劇演出</h2>\n<p>今次選角入面，經常被指撞樣的陳自瑤與倪嘉雯首次在同劇演出，從曝光的造型照可見，各人服飾華麗，角色性格鮮明，當中陳豪、龔嘉欣與陳自瑤的宮鬥組合，已令不少劇迷引頸以待。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586568017218_426766517_12451559036b012c60b5bf5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1063\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586568017218_426766517_12451559036b012c60b5bf5.jpg\" width=\"812\"/></a><figcaption>倪嘉雯飾演宮女。（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586492525819_426766517_13552820556b012c61e867e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"1047\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/tvbcomhk_1792143605_4009113586492525819_426766517_13552820556b012c61e867e.jpg\" width=\"808\"/></a><figcaption>陳自瑤飾演皇后！（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179523474757946255_1493959756b011bbc5dc8c-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179523474757946255_1493959756b011bbc5dc8c-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_1631243846b011b0d5ec2e-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/41_1631243846b011b0d5ec2e-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_12710056526b011b12c0422-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/42_12710056526b011b12c0422-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_9880963116b011b16b73fb-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/43_9880963116b011b16b73fb-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_7619146896b011b1ad70c0-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/44_7619146896b011b1ad70c0-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18801961996b011b1fcbcb0-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/45_18801961996b011b1fcbcb0-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_3610864016b011b25bd086-1024x576.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"540\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/46_3610864016b011b25bd086-1024x576.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:03:48.677575+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1085,"images":9,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T06:45:10+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:28.791030+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T06:57:21.999033+00:00","content_hash":"16e13d8e02920164610cf55edd74c43c009e72ef19935731dbc4e7fa71000556","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}